[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0276","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0276.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0647","title":"Orange Software Orange Web Server 2.1 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Orange Software Orange Web Server 2.1 基于 GoAhead Web 服务器开发，在处理不包含 HTTP 版本号的 HTTP GET 请求时存在输入验证缺陷。远程未认证攻击者可发送畸形的 HTTP GET 请求（缺少 HTTP/1.0 或 HTTP/1.1 版本标识），导致服务器进程崩溃或陷入死循环，造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 Orange Web Server 2.1 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程发起攻击，攻击复杂度低，仅影响服务可用性（CVSS 5.0，AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P）。攻击者只需向目标服务器发送精心构造的不含 HTTP 版本的 GET 请求即可触发拒绝服务，导致 Web 服务停止响应合法请求。ExploitDB (EDB-20655) 等公开渠道已披露 PoC 代码，攻击者可直接利用现成脚本发起攻击。建议升级至修复版本或迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0647"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-06T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:41.420","remediation":"建议立即升级 Orange Web Server 至 2.1 以上版本（建议升级至最新版本），或升级底层 GoAhead Web Server 至已修复该漏洞的版本（GoAhead 2.1.8 或更高版本已修复此 HTTP 版本缺失导致的 DoS 问题）。如无法立即升级，可在前端部署 WAF 或负载均衡器，配置规则拦截缺少 HTTP 版本号的 HTTP GET 请求（如 \"GET /path\" 而非 \"GET /path HTTP/1.0\"），或在防火墙层面拦截不符合 RFC 2616 规范的 HTTP 请求行作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快联系厂商获取官方补丁包并尽快部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/165658","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2432","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20655","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0647.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0647","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0647.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0647.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f2pj-5wrm-j9xg/GHSA-f2pj-5wrm-j9xg.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/orange_dos.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0647.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2432/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0276.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0265","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0265.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0623","title":"SAFT Sendfile 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SAFT（Simple Asynchronous File Transfer）套件中的 sendfiled 服务在发送通知邮件时未能正确降低权限，导致本地攻击者可利用该缺陷以提升的权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响多种 Linux 系统上包含 SAFT 的 Sendfile 1.x/2.1 版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0623"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:39.180","remediation":"升级 sendfile 至 2.1-20.2 或更高版本。Debian 2.2 (potato) 用户可通过 apt 更新：`apt-get update && apt-get install sendfile`，或从 `http://security.debian.org/dists/stable/updates/` 下载对应架构的 deb 包手动安装。如无法升级，建议禁用 sendfiled 服务（`/etc/init.d/sendfiled stop` 并移除自启动）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-050","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6430","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20795","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0623.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0623","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0623.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0623.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-050.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7pw9-r7h7-2x88/GHSA-7pw9-r7h7-2x88.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-052.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0623.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-050.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0265.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0265.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0265.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0259","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0259.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0610","title":"KDE KFM 临时文件符号链接漏洞","description":"KDE 1.x 中集成的文件管理器 KFM 在 /tmp 缓存目录下以不安全方式创建临时文件（.tmp），本地攻击者可利用符号链接（symlink）攻击，在 KFM 创建临时文件前预先建立指向目标文件的符号链接，从而劫持文件写入操作，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 SuSE 7.0 等使用 KDE 1.x 的系统，攻击者需拥有本地账户权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0610"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:37.737","remediation":"升级 KDE 至 2.0 及以上版本（KFM 在 KDE 2.0 中已修复此问题），或升级 SuSE Linux 至 7.1 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：手动删除 /tmp/kfm-cache-* 目录并以 root 执行 `chmod 700 /tmp/kfm-cache-*` 限制目录权限，或移除 kfm 二进制文件的 setuid 位（`chmod u-s /opt/kde/bin/kfm`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0336.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6428","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20781","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0610.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0610","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0610.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0610.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jxjg-6pwx-g6rw/GHSA-jxjg-6pwx-g6rw.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89002/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0610.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d3afd88d-73f9-4b84-a7f0-94c9897291d9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0259.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0258","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0258.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0609","title":"Infodrom cfingerd 格式字符串漏洞","description":"cfingerd 1.4.3 及更早版本中存在格式字符串漏洞，当该服务处理特制的 ident 响应时，会将用户可控的输入直接传递给 syslog 函数作为格式化字符串参数，导致攻击者可以利用格式字符串特性（如 %n、%s 等）实现任意内存读写。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标 cfingerd 服务发送恶意构造的 ident 响应触发该漏洞，从而获取系统额外权限，实现完全控制目标主机。该漏洞影响 Infodrom cfingerd 1.4.3 及之前所有版本，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0609"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:37.620","remediation":"升级 cfingerd 至 1.4.4 或更高版本（该版本修复了 syslog 格式化字符串漏洞）。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-049 安全公告，通过 `apt-get update && apt-get install cfingerd` 更新。如无法立即升级，可在 inetd/xinetd 配置中注释 cfingerd 行并重启服务以临时禁用 finger 协议，或通过防火墙限制对 79/TCP 端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0202.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2576","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6364","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20749","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0609.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0609","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0609.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0609.json","https://github.com/bb1nfosec/Information-Security-Tasks/blob/f4624a2c25d8fbfb76929a1d5b57dbb13dd8ca9d/feeds/2026-06-07.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-049.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fppm-3x24-27q8/GHSA-fppm-3x24-27q8.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/cfinger_format_bug.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0258.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0257","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0597","title":"Zetetic STRIP PalmOS 密码管理弱随机数导致暴力破解漏洞","description":"Zetetic 公司为 PalmOS 开发的密码管理工具 STRIP（Secure Tool for Recalling Important Passwords）0.5 及更早版本存在密码可被暴力破解的安全漏洞。该工具使用 SysRandom 函数生成随机数，而 SysRandom 以 TimeGetTicks（系统滴答计时器）作为种子，导致随机数可预测性极高。同时，其实现缺陷大幅缩减了密码搜索空间，使得本地攻击者能够通过暴力枚举方式在较短时间内恢复所有已存储的密码。该漏洞影响 STRIP 0.5 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，攻击者需具备本地访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0597"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:36.290","remediation":"立即停止使用 Zetetic STRIP 0.5 及更早版本，改用支持加密安全随机数生成器（CSPRNG）的密码管理工具（如 KeePass、1Password）。如必须继续使用 STRIP，请升级至 0.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SysRandom 种子熵不足导致的密码搜索空间大幅缩减问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0169.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2567","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6362","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20746","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0597.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0597","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0597.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0597.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-78c3-v436-q543/GHSA-78c3-v436-q543.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0597.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--03d379da-b98d-4af7-be42-117468d53ea3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0257.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0256","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0256.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0596","title":"Netscape Communicator GIF 图片 JavaScript 代码执行漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.77 及更早版本存在 GIF 图像 JavaScript 执行漏洞，攻击者可通过在 GIF 图像注释字段中嵌入任意 JavaScript 代码构造恶意图像。当用户使用受影响版本的 Netscape Communicator 查看该图像时，浏览器在解析 GIF 格式过程中未对注释内容进行安全过滤，导致注释中的脚本被自动执行。未经身份认证的远程攻击者利用该漏洞可获取受害者当前页面的 Cookie、会话令牌及浏览历史等敏感信息，进而实施会话劫持或进一步攻击。该漏洞影响范围涵盖所有未部署安全补丁的 Netscape Communicator 4.x 版本，无需用户额外交互即可在正常浏览过程中触发。CVSSv2 评分为 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络远程、攻击复杂度低、无需认证即可完成利用。Debian 及 RedHat 等主流 Linux 发行版均已发布安全公告（DSA-051、RHSA-2001-046）并推送修复补丁，用户应升级至 Netscape Communicator 4.77 或更高版本以彻底消除该风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0596"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:36.167","remediation":"将 Netscape Communicator 升级至 4.77 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。由于 Netscape Communicator 已停止维护，建议迁移至受现代浏览器（如 Firefox、Chrome 或 Edge）。如短期内无法升级或更换浏览器，可暂时禁用 JavaScript 执行，并避免打开来自不可信来源的 GIF 图片作为缓解措施。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-051 安全更新，Red Hat 用户应应用 RHSA-2001-046 补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000393","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-014-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98685237415117&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-051","http://www.osvdb.org/5579","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-046.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2637","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6344","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20791","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/84a32f54509ea69818fd2f28519fed9f2968cec3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0596.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0596","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0596.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4efe50030f98e26c62a2548f14fe89d9f72e2021/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0596.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3rw6-mp6q-pg53/GHSA-3rw6-mp6q-pg53.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-051.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2001-0596/final.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0256.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0256.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0256.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0255","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0255.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0595","title":"Sun Solaris kcms_configure KCMS_PROFILES 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7 和 8 系统中 kcsSUNWIOsolf.so 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置 KCMS_PROFILES 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5/2.6/7.0/8 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用 kcms_configure 程序传递超长环境变量即可触发溢出，进而以进程权限执行任意代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0595"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:36.060","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun 官方补丁：Solaris 7 安装补丁 108652-xx，Solaris 8 安装补丁 108653-xx（可通过 Oracle 支持门户下载）。如无法安装补丁，可执行 `chmod 0 /usr/openwin/bin/kcms_configure` 移除 setuid root 权限，或卸载 KCMS 软件包 `pkgrm SUNWkcs`。作为临时缓解措施，在系统环境变量中过滤 KCMS_PROFILES 的异常长度输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0203.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2605","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6365","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20768","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0595.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0595","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0595.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0595.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-792f-vcf6-566f/GHSA-792f-vcf6-566f.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/rpc_kcms.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/solaris251_103879.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0595.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0255.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0253","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0253.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0594","title":"Sun Microsystems Solaris 命令行缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7/8 系统中 kcms_configure 程序存在命令行参数缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 kcms_configure 传递过长的命令行参数触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，进而获取提升后的本地权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 7 和 Solaris 8 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响），攻击者需具备本地登录权限，通过构造超长命令行参数触发溢出并执行 Shellcode 实现本地提权。Sun Microsystems 已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0594"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:35.943","remediation":"建议立即安装最新的Solaris补丁更新包（针对Solaris 7.0和Solaris 8.0，应更新到最新的安全修复包）。如果无法立即完成补丁更新，作为临时缓解措施，可通过修改 `/etc/system` 文件禁用 `kcms`服务，限制对 `kcms_configure`命令的访问权限，并使用组策略确保只有授权系统管理员可以执行此命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0140.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2558","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6359","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A65","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A7","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20741","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0594.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0594","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0594.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0594.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-827c-6mjj-g23r/GHSA-827c-6mjj-g23r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0594.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6b2a64dc-68ee-4d5d-a0f2-c3e64d199d38.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2009/gb_solaris_111400_04.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0253.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0359","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0359.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1022","title":"GNU groff pic 工具格式字符串远程命令执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>GNU groff 1.16.1 及更早版本中的 pic 工具，以及 jgroff 1.15 之前版本，存在格式字符串漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标发送特制的 plot 命令，利用格式字符串说明符绕过 -S 选项限制，在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响使用 groff 处理图形输入的本地与远程环境，攻击者可借此获得系统控制权，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1022"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:25.770","remediation":"升级 groff 至 1.18 或更高版本以修复格式字符串漏洞。升级 Debian/Ubuntu 系统：运行 sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install groff。若无法立即升级，可临时通过 LPD 服务配置禁用远程打印队列访问权限以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000428","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-072","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-107","http://www.osvdb.org/1914","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-004.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/199706","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3103","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6918","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21037","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7bafe961419ed00378435555d77a3a118a4791ff/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1022.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1022","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/4948dee5e341ff32692dc62eeae7f36668f8c35e/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1022.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5617898f059d3b0e8512d99f6ddeb997782120e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1022.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-072.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fj6r-7wmg-qvf3/GHSA-fj6r-7wmg-qvf3.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1022.md","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-072.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--41d990f2-69c6-462c-a928-d0fe926d5609.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0359.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0280","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0280.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0514","title":"Netgear ME102 Linksys WAP11 802.11b SNMP协议信息泄露与拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Atmel 802.11b VNET-B 接入点 1.3 及更早版本的 SNMP 服务存在漏洞，Netgear ME102 和 Linksys WAP11 等采用该芯片组的设备受影响。该漏洞源于 SNMP 服务未正确验证社区字符串，接受任意社区字符串并允许请求的 MIB 修改操作。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过网络发送恶意 SNMP 请求，利用该漏洞获取敏感信息（如 WEP 加密密钥）、导致拒绝服务或获得网络访问权限。CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0514"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:26.680","remediation":"建议立即升级 Atmel 802.11b VNET-B Access Point 固件至 1.3 以上版本，Netgear ME102 用户升级至固件 2.1.1 以上，Linksys WAP11 用户升级至固件 1.3 以上版本。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面封锁 UDP 161/162 端口（SNMP 端口），或在无线 AP 管理界面将 SNMP 社区字符串修改为复杂随机字符串并禁用 SNMP 写权限（仅保留只读）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2896","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise83.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6576","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0514.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0514","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0514.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0514.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2001-0514-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-75j3-qq88-rrpc/GHSA-75j3-qq88-rrpc.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2014/gb_snmp_get_community.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0514.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0280.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0200","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0500","title":"Microsoft IIS Index Server ISAPI 扩展缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Index Server 2.0 和 Indexing Service 2000 中的 ISAPI 扩展（idq.dll）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，在 IIS 6.0 及更早版本中尤为严重。该漏洞源于在处理 Internet Data Administration (.ida) 和 Internet Data Query (.idq) 文件时，系统未能对用户输入的长度进行有效校验，导致攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的数据包触发缓冲区溢出，致使恶意代码在目标系统中执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 及更早版本的 Microsoft IIS 服务，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可远程利用此漏洞， CVSS 评分高达 10.0（CVSS 向量：AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），表明其对系统保密性、完整性和可用性的极度严重影响。攻击者可通过构造精心-crafted 的 .idq 文件实现远程代码执行或获取系统控制权。微软已发布安全更新修补了该漏洞，用户应及时应用补丁以确保系统安全。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0500"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:25.420","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全更新 Q300972（MS01-033），该补丁修复了 idq.dll 在 Index Server 2.0 及 Indexing Service 中处理 .ida 和 .idq 请求时存在的缓冲区溢出漏洞。受影响系统包括 Windows NT 4.0 IIS 4.0 与 Windows 2000 IIS 5.0，补丁已包含在 Windows 2000 Service Pack 3 及后续版本中，也可通过 Microsoft Update 或 Windows Update 自动获取。如暂时无法安装补丁，可先在 IIS 管理控制台中删除 .idq 和 .ida 文件的脚本映射作为临时缓解措施，但需注意该映射在系统组件变更时可能自动恢复，因此建议尽快应用补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-13.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-098.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6705.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/191873","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2880","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-033","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A197","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20933","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0500.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0500.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0500","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0500.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0500.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gcxg-pq25-8wh2/GHSA-gcxg-pq25-8wh2.json","https://github.com/decal/werdlists/blob/81edb463f7f6311c85defefaf75ac9cd58e5cfb9/exploit-info/symantec-attack-signatures.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/iis_ida_isapi.nasl","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0200.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0200.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0199","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0199.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0499","title":"Oracle 8i TNS Listener 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oracle 8i 的透明网络底层（TNS）监听器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 STATUS、PING、SERVICES、TRC_FILE、SAVE_CONFIG 或 RELOAD 等命令发送超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取目标系统的完全控制权限。该漏洞影响 Oracle 8i 8.1.7 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Metasploit 框架已集成该漏洞的利用模块，攻击者可轻易实现远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0499"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:25.310","remediation":"升级 Oracle 8i 至 9.0.1 及以上版本，或安装 Oracle 2001 年第 2 季度关键补丁集。在 listener.ora 中设置 ADMIN_RESTRICTIONS_LISTENER=ON 并配置监听器密码，限制 TNS Listener 仅接受受信任 IP 的连接，在防火墙上封禁 1521 端口的非授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-16.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/620495","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/050.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2941","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6758","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20980","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0499.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0499.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0499","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0499.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0499.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x55p-rh55-qcxv/GHSA-x55p-rh55-qcxv.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/KvasirSecurity/Kvasir/blob/a5b3775184a8343240e1154a1f762f75df04dc0a/static/etc/canvas_exploits.xml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0499.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0148","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0148.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0341","title":"Microsoft Visual Studio RAD Support 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 中的 Visual Studio RAD Support 子组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 fp30reg.dll 发送超长注册请求（URL）触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Visual Studio 及 FrontPage Server Extensions 相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 MS03-051 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0341"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:07.960","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS03-051 提供的更新补丁，或升级至受支持的最新 Windows 版本及 IIS 版本。如无法安装补丁，可在 IIS 中移除 FPSE 扩展映射（删除 .dll 关联）或禁用 FrontPage Server Extensions 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99348216322147&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/577","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2906","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-035","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6730","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20951","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0341.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0341.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0341","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0341.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ppvh-qjhq-qjwm/GHSA-ppvh-qjhq-qjwm.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/97a17708b9a16c731a8a37abc74c9e94d43d7b3f/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0341.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/F/frontpage_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0148.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0148.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0001","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0537","title":"Cisco IOS HTTP配置任意管理访问漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 11.3 至 12.2 版本的 HTTP 配置服务器存在认证绕过漏洞。当设备启用本地授权（local authorization）时，远程攻击者无需有效凭据，只需在 URL 中指定高访问级别参数即可绕过身份验证机制，直接获取设备的完全管理权限。攻击者可利用该漏洞执行任意命令，完全控制目标路由器或交换机，导致网络基础设施被接管。该漏洞利用方式简单，仅需向目标设备的 HTTP 管理接口发送特制请求即可触发，危害极大。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0537"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:29.157","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.2(4) 或更高版本，或禁用 HTTP 服务器（使用 `no ip http server` 命令），改用 HTTPS 并配置 AAA 认证。如必须使用 HTTP，在接口 ACL 中限制仅允许受信管理 IP 访问 80 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-14.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-106.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/IOS-httplevel-pub.html","http://www.osvdb.org/578","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/1601227034.20010702112207%40olympos.org","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/20010703011650.60515.qmail%40web14910.mail.yahoo.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/4.3.2.7.2.20010629095801.0c3e6a70%40brussels.cisco.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/Pine.LNX.3.96.1010702134611.22995B-100000%40Lib-Vai.lib.asu.edu","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2936","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6749","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20978","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2001/CVE-2001-0537.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0537.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2001/CVE-2001-0537.yaml","https://github.com/PortSwigger/BChecks/blob/7117c5ff8d1d47ca6282020a243b4d3026480ad5/vulnerabilities-CVEd/CVE-2001-0537%20CISCO%20Authentication%20Bypass.bcheck","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0537.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2001-0537_5_1.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2001-0537_3.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0537.json","https://github.com/rokkamvamshi/attack-surface-management/blob/c988ba43c9b670a9983bbc30e2493422ae577605/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2001/CVE-2001-0537.yaml","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/0fcfb8c0516a8ea2563628979ef2eb68236527b2/data/lists/NucleiList.txt","https://github.com/rishikesh-j/Nuclei-Templates-Scrapped/blob/c1c4a009b3ada12b7923dcbc40e099ce8f224b2c/templates/CVE-2001-0537.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0001.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0001.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0149","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0149.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0348","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet 服务在处理超长登录命令中的退格符时存在缓冲区处理缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统的 Telnet 端口（默认23）发送特制请求，触发服务进程崩溃，导致合法用户无法正常登录。该漏洞源于 Telnet 服务对特殊字符序列的边界检查不充分，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可实施，影响所有 Windows 2000 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0348"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-21","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-031 提供的补丁程序，或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 3 及以上版本。如无需使用 Telnet 服务，建议在服务管理器中禁用 Telnet Service (tlntsvr) 以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://razor.bindview.com/publish/advisories/adv_mstelnet.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-092.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2838","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-031","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6666","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20907"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0149.toml"}]